& [Interpretation] is bounded
  + [finding] is physical persistence is not the dominant repeated-query cost in the current resident adapter
  + [finding] is signature admission and fabric reconstruction dominate the 256-package measured path
  + [finding] is the 44 through 45 versus 21943 through 22441 microsecond contrast identifies an optimization surface but is not a projected end-to-end prepared-runtime latency
